stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Wizard
    Wizard --> Z1: skip / unsure
    Z1 --> Personas: nearest-persona match (offered)

    Wizard --> A1: pre-menarche
    A1 --> A2: first period
    A2 --> B1: cycles regularize / turns 16
    A2 --> A3: heavy / painful
    A2 --> A4: PCOS-adjacent
    A2 --> A5: >90d gaps

    Wizard --> B1: cycle tracking
    B1 --> B6: irregular + PCOS
    B6 --> C6: sets TTC intent
    B1 --> C1: sets TTC intent

    Wizard --> C1: trying to conceive
    C1 --> C2: 12mo(<35), never pregnant
    C1 --> C4: prior child
    C1 --> C5: 2+ losses
    C1 --> C8: thyroid
    C2 --> C10: starts IUI/IVF
    C4 --> C10: starts IUI/IVF

    C1 --> D1: positive test
    C2 --> D1: positive test (PAI)
    C5 --> D2: positive test (PAL)
    C8 --> D7: positive test [FLAGSHIP]

    Wizard --> D1: pregnant
    D1 --> D3: gestational diabetes
    D1 --> D4: pre-existing diabetes
    D1 --> D5: chronic HTN
    D1 --> D6: pre-eclampsia
    D1 --> D7: thyroid
    D5 --> D6: superimposed PE (blend)

    D1 --> E1: delivery
    D3 --> E4: delivery (T2DM screen)
    D4 --> E4: delivery (ongoing DM)
    D5 --> E4: delivery (BP follow-up)
    D6 --> E4: delivery (BP follow-up)
    D7 --> E7: delivery (PPT watch)
    D1 --> E6: loss

    E1 --> E3: EPDS elevated
    E1 --> B1: return of cycle
    E1 --> C1: return of cycle + TTC

    Wizard --> F1: perimenopause
    F1 --> F2: 12mo amenorrhea
    F1 --> F3: comorbidity
    F1 --> F4: surgical / induced
    B6 --> F1: perimenopause overlap
